AI-GENERATED CODE

All source code in this repository was generated by an AI model: Claude
(made by Anthropic, used through Claude Code),
working under the direction of Pearce Harshbarger. Every source file
carries a header that says so. AI was also used to research public
documentation and to draft the text of the documentation and submission.

The concept and its five ideas are the team owner's own, written in their
design note "Tombaugh: a blink comparator for the 102-color sky"
(13 November 2026). The AI was not the source of the idea.

The repository contains no AI-generated images or video. The preview
animations on the landing page are drawn procedurally by code in the
browser. See docs/AI-USE.md for the full log.


